{"meta": {"family": "multicol"}, "regions": [{"id": "multicol-1/title", "bbox": [40.0, 24.0, 984.0, 64.0], "text": "Controller Family Hardware Specification - Chapter 5", "role": "title", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/col0", "bbox": [40.0, 90.0, 334.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s1h", "bbox": [40.0, 90.0, 334.0, 118.0], "text": "5.1 LM-2 Thermal Management", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s1p", "bbox": [40.0, 122.0, 334.0, 194.0], "text": "The LM-2 thermal shutdown threshold is 37 C; fan speed ramps linearly from 90 C.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s2h", "bbox": [40.0, 220.0, 334.0, 248.0], "text": "5.2 LM-2 Power Sequencing", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s2p", "bbox": [40.0, 252.0, 334.0, 324.0], "text": "Rails of the LM-2 power up in order 3V3, 1V8, 0V9 with 48 ms spacing; brownout trips at 20 mV.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s3h", "bbox": [40.0, 350.0, 334.0, 378.0], "text": "5.3 LM-2 Bus Interface", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s3p", "bbox": [40.0, 382.0, 334.0, 454.0], "text": "The LM-2 SPI bus clock is limited to 109 MHz; CRC errors above 24 per hour raise a fault.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s4h", "bbox": [40.0, 480.0, 334.0, 508.0], "text": "5.4 LM-2 Firmware Update", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s4p", "bbox": [40.0, 512.0, 334.0, 584.0], "text": "LM-2 firmware images are signed; rollback is blocked below version 101.87.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col0", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/col1", "bbox": [364.0, 90.0, 658.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s5h", "bbox": [364.0, 90.0, 658.0, 118.0], "text": "5.5 HB-1 Firmware Update", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s5p", "bbox": [364.0, 122.0, 658.0, 194.0], "text": "HB-1 firmware images are signed; rollback is blocked below version 27.64.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s6h", "bbox": [364.0, 220.0, 658.0, 248.0], "text": "5.6 HB-1 Watchdog Timer", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s6p", "bbox": [364.0, 252.0, 658.0, 324.0], "text": "The HB-1 watchdog timeout is 38 ms; the window opens after 17 ms and a missed kick forces reset.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s7h", "bbox": [364.0, 350.0, 658.0, 378.0], "text": "5.7 HB-1 Power Sequencing", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s7p", "bbox": [364.0, 382.0, 658.0, 454.0], "text": "Rails of the HB-1 power up in order 3V3, 1V8, 0V9 with 60 ms spacing; brownout trips at 67 mV.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s8h", "bbox": [364.0, 480.0, 658.0, 508.0], "text": "5.8 HB-1 Bus Interface", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s8p", "bbox": [364.0, 512.0, 658.0, 584.0], "text": "The HB-1 SPI bus clock is limited to 30 MHz; CRC errors above 90 per hour raise a fault.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col1", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/col2", "bbox": [688.0, 90.0, 982.0, 1000.0], "text": "", "role": "container", "parent": null, "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s9h", "bbox": [688.0, 90.0, 982.0, 118.0], "text": "5.9 XR-7 Power Sequencing", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s9p", "bbox": [688.0, 122.0, 982.0, 194.0], "text": "Rails of the XR-7 power up in order 3V3, 1V8, 0V9 with 61 ms spacing; brownout trips at 48 mV.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s10h", "bbox": [688.0, 220.0, 982.0, 248.0], "text": "5.10 XR-7 Firmware Update", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s10p", "bbox": [688.0, 252.0, 982.0, 324.0], "text": "XR-7 firmware images are signed; rollback is blocked below version 63.30.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s11h", "bbox": [688.0, 350.0, 982.0, 378.0], "text": "5.11 XR-7 Bus Interface", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s11p", "bbox": [688.0, 382.0, 982.0, 454.0], "text": "The XR-7 SPI bus clock is limited to 55 MHz; CRC errors above 45 per hour raise a fault.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s12h", "bbox": [688.0, 480.0, 982.0, 508.0], "text": "5.12 XR-7 Watchdog Timer", "role": "heading", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}, {"id": "multicol-1/s12p", "bbox": [688.0, 512.0, 982.0, 584.0], "text": "The XR-7 watchdog timeout is 21 ms; the window opens after 97 ms and a missed kick forces reset.", "role": "text", "parent": "multicol-1/col2", "links": []}]}